---
config:
  sequence:
    actorMargin: 10
    width: 100
    messageMargin: 30
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Test as Your test
  participant Agent as Your agent
  participant AR as agent-retrace
  participant API as Provider API
  participant Tool as Your tool
  participant File as Recording file

  Test->>AR: replay(name, fn)
  AR->>Agent: run fn()
  Agent->>AR: LLM request
  AR->>API: forward it
  API-->>AR: "call lookup_order"
  AR-->>Agent: same response
  Note over AR: keep step 1 (llm)
  Agent->>AR: lookup_order call
  AR->>Tool: run the tool
  Tool-->>AR: order B2 shipped
  AR-->>Agent: same result
  Note over AR: keep step 2 (tool)
  Agent->>AR: LLM request
  AR->>API: forward it
  API-->>AR: final answer
  AR-->>Agent: same response
  Note over AR: keep step 3 (llm)
  Agent-->>AR: fn returns
  AR->>File: write steps 1 to 3
  AR-->>Test: replay() returns
